# Nyra: the time service that systemd-timedated reports and turns on and off ("timedatectl set-ntp",
# the desktop's automatic time switch) is the restricted NTS client (docs/DEFAULTS.md, "Time").
# It sorts before chrony's own 50-chrony.list, so chrony.service is never started in its place.
chronyd-restricted.service
